<tr><td colspan=2>Greeting to my Brothers and Sisters!  *Bows to everyone*  <br>
     Battle Cry has requested the presence of the Bloodhorde this Saturday at 9am PST (I think it is PST will comfirm this) in the City of Mist in Kunark.   All seasons 35+ are welcomed.  They ask that you be present by the start time I have posted.  The raid is expected to go to 1pm PST.  If you have any further questions send Dian or Wolfbasher of BC a magic tell.  Remeber to get binded in the appropriate locations and get your weapons sharpened for this one!!   Let's show them what it means to be BLOODHORDE!!!   RARRRRRRRR!!! <br>
May Hate be our guide!<br>
Zherron Karahan<br>
