<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1887&lastnode_id=175">Raiding guide for Saturday and Beyond</a> (1 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1639&lastnode_id=175">Pustule</a> on 2001-06-08 11:28:55</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Greetings to the Horde.<br>
<br>
My apologies for bumping Voness' previous post, but I felt it important enough given our planned Fear raid on Saturday.  There is an EXCELLENT guide for raiding located at:<br>
<br>
http://www.xegonyalliance.com/resources.html<br>
<br>
Along with posts on dam/delay, haste items, and armor comparisons, it has detailed raiding strategies for Fear, Hate, Sky, Kedge, the Hole, Growth, and a number of other high-level places.  Ive already downloaded and printed the Fear guide, and I encourage others to do so also. For some, this will be the first time in Fear (wed debacle not counting) and there is no way that Voness could possibly be able to shout everything you need to know. For those that are experienced in Fear, it would still be a good read (I know its gotten me through lunch at work hehe).  There are detailed descriptions of the mobs in Fear, armor drops, and strats for establishing the West camp, pulling the wanderers, and what to do when Cazic comes-a-calling.<br>
<br>
Hopefully everyone will at least give this site a quick perusal, as I think its very informative and can only help us come Saturday<br>
<br>
ooc - By the way, i'll be there *cackle*<br>
<br>
