<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1841&lastnode_id=175">Hate Raid and Guild Meeting Report!</a> (1 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=192&lastnode_id=175">Runja</a> on 2001-06-03 21:14:17</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>RARR!<br>
<br>
Me iz much happy to say dat our first raid of da Plane of Hate wuz a huge success!  Being our first time dere, it wuz a bit slow going at timez, but weez did manage to clear da entire first floor!  Weez even killed da Maestro of Rancor and da Hand of the Maestro, which den spawned into da "very unpleasant hand"!  Dat battles were filled wit blood, but weez were victorious!<br>
<br>
Weez were also able to obtain many nice itemz from da cold, dead bodiez of our enemies!  Brumm gots da warrior gauntlets, Thul wuz da winner fer da warrior BP, Ulul got da warrior helm, Azhrarn obtained da cleric helm and shield, Jezelle gots da rogue boots, and Kementari got da rogue helm!  Also weez obtained da "maesto's hand" for da Warrior Epic weapon quest which wuz award to Annilaotor! RARR!!!<br>
<br>
Weez also had sum guests at da raid to assist in da slaughter of da hate inhabitants.  Cleric arms went to Kerili, cleric helm and bracer went to Gratzi, two different pally shields went to Catatonic and Danarx, pally legs went to Danarx, and iksar shaman bracer went to Slathew!  Much congratulationz to all who obtained new equipment!<br>
<br>
Me wants to specifically mention dat weez also had da rogue breastplate drop.  Kementari wuz da official winner of da roll for dat much coveted piece of armor.  However, out of da evil in her heart, Kementari awarded da rogue BP to Voness who had failed to win da BP several times in da past.  As a gesture to Kementari's generosity, Voness gave heem's Red Dragonscale Breastplate to Kementari!  Me just wants to put out a big RARR! to Kementari for her generosity!  Dats da kind of stuff me likes to see and dat iz what makes us BLOODHORDE!<br>
<br>
Me would like ta thank Durdindevyr and Cindell fer deir much appriciated help!  Yoo guyz are great!<br>
<br>
Me wuz able ta uze da majik '-' key to record sum imagez of our hate raid:<br>
<br>
<a href='/pics/060201/HateRaid1.jpg'><img src='/pics/060201/HateRaid1s.jpg'></a><a href='/pics/060201/HateHand1.jpg'><img src='/pics/060201/HateHand1s.jpg'></a><br>
<br>
<h4>Guild Meeting Notes!</h4><br>
Weez had a great, no, AMAZING guild meeting today!  A large number of uz met in da Arena to watch sum of da new members perform da Test of Blood.  Da battlez were fierce and much blood wuz spilled!  Me iz much proud of all who dueled!  It iz great to see so many skilled in da art of bloodshed!<br>
<br>
Promotions RARR!<br>
<br>
Lazier, Slackjaw, Pustule, Zmaka, and Dizeez were all promoted to Horde Member!<br>
<br>
Brumm haz been promoted to da rank of Bone Guard!  Brumm haz constantly shown hiz support of da horde and its members.  All congratulate Brumm on heems promotion!<br>
<br>
Annilaotor haz been promoted to da rank of Bone Guard Champion!!  Annilaotor haz shown dat he iz much skilled in da art of battle and battle strategy.  Heem iz now our first Bone Guard Champion!!!<br>
<br>
Also, sistah Freyja was assigned da position of guild recruiter.  Guild recruiters now are Freyja, Gnormagn, Izayo, and Ozzwald.  Pleez direct any new interested peeple to dem!<br>
<br>
Also, weez had 3 new members join da horde today.  Bulky iz a 28 ogre warrior, Arryl iz a 27 inky cleric, and Gaki iz a 37 ogre shaddernite!  Be sure to welcome dese new evil soulz into our family!<br>
<br>
Last, but certainly not least, Brumm and Ulul have been named Raid Commanders!  Dey will be responsible for organizing and excuting raids fer da season 45 and under horde members!  Dis is a big responsibility as me tinks we need to do more of dese kinds of raids so dat when some of our younger memberz get old enough to go to da planes, dey will have da skills and knowledge necessary to succeed!  RARR Brumm and Ulul!  Me iz excited ta see what carnage yooz will create!<br>
<br>
<center><br>
<a href='/pics/060201/GuildMeeting1.jpg'><img src='/pics/060201/GuildMeeting1s.jpg'></a><br><font size=1>Iz dis not da most evil bunch yooz ever seen?</font></center><br>
<br>
RARR Bloodhorde!!<br>
<br>
Runja Blackblood<br>
Warlord of Bloodhorde<br>
